# Repo-root ignores. Each package also has its own .gitignore (eBilihan-app/.gitignore)
# — a .gitignore only covers its own directory downwards, which is why root-level files
# have to be listed here.

# Never commit real credentials in any form.
.env
.env.local
credentials.txt

# `credentials.txt` is ALREADY TRACKED, so this line does not hide it — git ignores only
# untracked files. It exists to stop the file being re-added after deletion. Removing it
# from the working tree also does not remove it from the commits behind it: every value
# it has ever held must be treated as compromised and rotated in the API Developer Portal,
# independently of any history rewrite. See README.md > Credential hygiene.
